== route 1: predefined macros (compile-time, per target) ==
  __linux        absent   
  __linux__      absent   
  __GLIBC__      absent   MSYS2 用 mingw-w64 crt,不是 glibc
  _UCRT          DEFINED  MSYS2 UCRT64 环境定义,Universal CRT
  _WIN32         DEFINED  Win32/Win64 都定义(目标为 Windows)
  _WIN64         DEFINED  仅 64 位 Windows 目标
  __MINGW64__    DEFINED  MinGW-w64 工具链
  __CYGWIN__     absent   
  __APPLE__      absent   两侧都不该出现,作对照
  __FreeBSD__    absent   kqueue 的家,本机没有
== route 2: __has_include probes (compile-time, per toolchain) ==
  <sys/epoll.h>      ABSENT   
  <sys/event.h>      ABSENT   Linux 上没有 kqueue
  <liburing.h>       ABSENT   
  <windows.h>        present  Win32 全家
  <sys/inotify.h>    ABSENT   
== runtime: GetSystemInfo (information macros can never carry) ==
  processor_architecture=9 number_of_processors=16
